      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "33. 用逐次逼近法求平方根的近似值"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假设需要计算 $\\sqrt{2}$ 精确到 $0.0001$. 很明显，$1<\\sqrt{2}<2$.",
        "我们把 $1$ 当作第一次近似值. 那么",
        "$\\sqrt{2}=1+a_1$， $(1)$",
        "这里 $a_1$ 是第一次近似值的误差，并且",
        "$0<a_1<1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把等式（1）两边平方，得：",
        "$2=1+2a_1+a_1^2$."
      ]
    },
